Z||000000||85ZainoGT||09-16-2001||01:49 AM||||ya, so the past two nights, I did what I usually do, go downtown, or to a city where there will be cars, well it turns out everyone wanted to race me tonight and las night  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> YAH!!  here is the list:<P>1. 2000 ford escort (umm... i know)  jus him and I had 1 passenger<BR>2. 1993 ford probe gt (  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) (pretty good race going from 45mph, but when we went from a light.. hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> no chance for him)  I had 1 passenger, he was alone<BR>3. 2001 Kia (uhhhhhh, he had a neon light, I had too).. jus him, and 1 passenger for me<BR>4. 1995 camaro v6 (my fav kill... finally got my camaro that I wanted to race, a v6.. beat him!)... 1 passenger for both of us...<BR>5. 93 or 94 300zx heh, he revved at me as I was about to turn, so I didnt turn, and went and caught up with him, revved at him, and he laughed at me, so we got a light  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  and uhh...  through first I had 2 cars on him, then 3rd gear he redlined  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> 1 passenger for both of us...<BR>6. (new) subaru impreza  didnt have a chance from the line...  kinda hung from about 60mph.. no passengers for him, 1 in my car<BR>7. 1999 honda civic si lets jus say, I thought these were fast.. I thought wrong...no passengers in his car, 1 in mine..<P>   anyways, Me, my car, and my girl had a great night of drivin  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  well the night was great, but there was one loss, a mercury cougar, pretty quick cars... anyways, he raced the 300zx and me... was fun though... ||||reg||1
